      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Evaluate $-6a-\\frac{1}{5}$ for $a=\\frac{1}{3}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Replacing $a$ with $\\frac{1}{3}$ in the expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-6a-\\frac{1}{5} & = \\\\ -6(\\frac{1}{3})-\\frac{1}{5} & = \\\\ -\\frac{6}{3}-\\frac{1}{5} & = \\\\ -2-\\frac{1}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{(-2)\\cdot 5-1}{5} & = \\\\ -\\frac{11}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
