      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "If $x=2,$ then $12-4(3x-4)=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "We replace $x$ with $2$ in the expression and evaluate the parentheses first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12-4(3x-4) & = \\\\ 12-4(3\\cdot 2-4) & = \\\\ 12-4(6-4) & = \\\\ 12-4(2) & = \\\\ 12-8 & = \\\\ 4 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
