      "problem": "If $w=2$ and $z=-4,$ then $w+5z=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "Replacing $w$ with $2$ and $z$ with $-4,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w+5z & = \\\\ 2+5(-4) & = \\\\ 2-20 & = \\\\ -18 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
