      "dom_id": "step-q180270",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "If $p=2$ and $q=-1,$ then $-p+3q=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "Replacing $p$ with $2$ and $q$ with $-1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-p+3q & = \\\\ -(2)+3(-1) & = \\\\ -2-3 & = \\\\ -5 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
